rt and literature review</article-title><source>Surg Neurol</source><year>2004</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>304</fpage><lpage>311</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15451272</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.surneu.2003.10.045</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>